  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds write via bz2 stream reuse after a\n     decompression error (CVE-2026-9669)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-9669.patch: record the libbz2 error code on the\n       BZ2Decompressor and BZ2File objects in Modules/bz2module.c and refuse\n       every later decompress() or read() call, so BZ2_bzDecompress() is never\n       re-entered on a stream libbz2 has already reported an error for; adds\n       regression tests for both paths to Lib/test/test_bz2.py\n     - CVE-2026-9669",
